---
import Layout from "../../../layouts/Layout.astro";

const title = "観測者は恋を知る 改訂版";
const description =
  "理性で心を閉ざした大学講師・藤堂圭と、執着にも似た想いを向ける教え子・秋吉悠也。年下執着攻め×眼鏡受け、傷を抱えた大人の再生を描くBL小説『観測者は恋を知る』改訂版・特設サイト。";
---

<Layout title={title} description={description}>
  <div class="lp-container">
    {/* ① HERO */}
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="diagram-overlay"></div>
      <div class="hero-content">
        <h1 class="hero-title">
          <span>観測者は</span><br />
          <span>恋を知る</span>
        </h1>
        <div class="hero-copy-group">
          <p class="hero-catch">
            感情はノイズだと、ずっとそう思っていた。<br />
            その眼差しに囚われるまでは。
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="scroll-indicator">
        <span>Scroll</span>
        <div class="line"></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    {/* ② STORY / PREMISE */}
    <section class="story-section">
      <div class="section-container">
        <h2 class="section-title-en">STORY</h2>
        <div class="glass-card story-card">
          <div class="story-content">
            <p>彼は、気づいていない。</p>
            <p>スツールの角度を直さなかったことも。</p>
            <p>視線が合うたびに、鼓動が跳ねる理由も。</p>
            <p>誰かが彼を「道具」にした瞬間、</p>
            <p>自分でも驚くほどの怒りがこみあげたことも。</p>
            <p>ちいさな羊羹の箱に残る体温を、確かめてしまったことも。</p>
            <p>理性という名の鎧は、とうに穴だらけだった。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    {/* ③ CHARACTERS */}
    <section class="characters">
      <div class="section-container">
        <h2 class="section-title-en">CHARACTERS</h2>
        <div class="char-grid">
          <div class="char-card glass-card">
            <div class="char-info">
              <span class="char-role">University Student</span>
              <h3 class="char-name">秋吉 悠也 <span>Akiyoshi Yuya</span></h3>
              <p class="char-quote">「藤堂先生に指導してもらいたいです」</p>
              <div class="char-desc">
                <p>
                  才能も容姿も恵まれながら、<br />
                  満たされない渇きを抱える年下の天才。
                </p>
                <p>
                  はじめて『本気で向き合ってくれた』圭に<br />
                  執着にも似た一途な想いを向け、迷いなく踏み込んでいく。
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="char-card glass-card">
            <div class="char-info">
              <span class="char-role">Lecturer</span>
              <h3 class="char-name">藤堂 圭 <span>Todo Kei</span></h3>
              <p class="char-quote">
                「感情に価値はない。判断を鈍らせるだけだ」
              </p>
              <div class="char-desc">
                <p>
                  理性を信奉し、<br />
                  誰にも心を開かない孤高の大学講師。
                </p>
                <p>
                  だがその冷たさの奥には、<br />
                  裏切りによって刻まれた深い傷を隠している。
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    {/* ④ RELATIONSHIP / POINT */}
    <section class="point-section">
      <div class="section-container">
        <h2 class="section-title-en">POINT</h2>
        <div class="point-grid">
          <div class="point-card glass-card">
            <h3>理性が崩れていく恋</h3>
            <p>冷静で理知的な男が、少しずつ恋に呑まれていく過程。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="point-card glass-card">
            <h3>知性で惹かれ合う関係性</h3>
            <p>尊敬と執着が恋へ変わる、知的共鳴型BL。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="point-card glass-card">
            <h3>年下執着攻め</h3>
            <p>明るく見えて危うい、迷いのない一途な愛。</p>
          </div>
          <div class="point-card glass-card">
            <h3>傷を抱えた大人の再生譚</h3>
            <p>感情を抑え続けてきた男が、はじめて心のままに選び取る物語。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    {/* ⑥ CTA */}
    <section class="cta-section">
      <div class="cta-card glass-card">
        <h2 class="section-title-en">READ NOW</h2>
        <p class="cta-heading">物語の続きは、カクヨムで。</p>
        <p class="cta-text">
          理性と恋がせめぎ合うその結末を、<br />
          どうか最後まで見届けてください。
        </p>
        <a
          href="https://kakuyomu.jp/works/2912051598581907032"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="cta-button"
        >
          カクヨムで<br class="br-mobile" />連載中の本編を読む
          <svg
            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
            width="20"
            height="20"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M12 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg
          >
        </a>
      </div>
    </section>

    {/* ⑦ FOOTNOTE */}
    <footer class="lp-footnote">
      <p>※本作は2025年に発表した旧版を全面改稿した改訂版です。</p>
    </footer>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  :root {
    --lp-bg: #fffafa;
    --lp-text: #5d4a4a;
    --lp-text-dim: #9b8a8a;
    --lp-accent: #d8a7b1;
    --lp-glass: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5);
    --lp-glass-border: rgba(216, 167, 177, 0.3);
  }

  .lp-container {
    background-color: var(--lp-bg);
    color: var(--lp-text);
    margin: -2rem -1rem;
    padding: 0 1rem;
    overflow-x: hidden;
  }

  .section-container {
    max-width: 1000px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 1.5rem;
  }

  .glass-card {
    background: var(--lp-glass);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    border: 1px solid var(--lp-glass-border);
    border-radius: 4px;
    padding: 2.5rem 2rem;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(216, 167, 177, 0.1);
  }

  .section-title-en {
    font-size: 1.1rem; /* さらに小さくさりげなく */
    letter-spacing: 0.4em; /* 字間を広げて宝石のような配置に */
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 1.8rem; /* タイトルとコンテンツの距離も縮小 */
    color: var(--lp-accent);
    font-weight: 300;
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  /* --- Hero Section --- */
  .hero {
    height: 90vh;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    text-align: center;
    position: relative;
    background: radial-gradient(circle at center, #ffffff 0%, #fff0f3 100%);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .hero::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(rgba(216, 167, 177, 0.1) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(216, 167, 177, 0.1) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 100px 100px;
    mask-image: radial-gradient(circle at center, black, transparent 80%);
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .hero::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    width: 800px;
    height: 800px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(216, 167, 177, 0.1);
    border-radius: 50%;
    top: 50%;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .diagram-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    bottom: 0;
    z-index: 0;
    opacity: 0.4;
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .diagram-overlay::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    width: 400px;
    height: 400px;
    border: 0.5px solid rgba(216, 167, 177, 0.2);
    top: 20%;
    left: 10%;
    transform: rotate(45deg);
  }

  .diagram-overlay::after {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    width: 300px;
    height: 300px;
    border: 0.5px solid rgba(216, 167, 177, 0.2);
    border-radius: 50%;
    bottom: 10%;
    right: 5%;
  }

  .hero-content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }

  .hero-label {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.3em;
    color: var(--lp-accent);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    animation: fadeInDown 1.5s ease-out;
  }

  .hero-title {
    font-size: clamp(3rem, 10vw, 5.5rem);
    font-weight: 300;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    line-height: 1.3;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .hero-title span {
    display: inline-block;
    animation: fadeInUp 1.5s ease-out;
  }

  .hero-copy-group {
    animation: fadeIn 2s ease-out 1s both;
  }

  .hero-catch {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    margin-bottom: 0;
    color: var(--lp-text);
  }

  .hero-subcopy {
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--lp-text-dim);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }

  .scroll-indicator {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 1.5rem; /* より下端に寄せる */
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.8rem; /* 少し詰め */
    color: var(--lp-text-dim);
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  }

  .scroll-indicator .line {
    width: 1px;
    height: 45px; /* 60pxから短縮して余白を確保 */
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--lp-accent), transparent);
    animation: scrollLine 2s infinite;
  }

  /* --- Story Section --- */
  .story-section {
    padding: 4rem 0; /* さらに削減 */
  }

  .story-card {
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .story-content {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 2.2;
  }

  .story-highlight {
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    margin-top: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--lp-text);
  }

  /* --- Characters Section --- */
  .characters {
    padding: 3rem 0;
  }

  .char-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .char-role {
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--lp-accent);
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .char-name {
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
  }

  .char-name span {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--lp-text-dim);
    display: block;
    font-weight: 300;
    margin-top: 0.2rem;
  }

  .char-quote {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--lp-accent);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    font-style: italic;
    border-left: 2px solid var(--lp-accent);
    padding-left: 1rem;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .char-desc {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    color: var(--lp-text-dim);
    text-align: left;
  }

  /* --- Point Section --- */
  .point-section {
    padding: 4rem 0;
  }

  .point-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .point-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    color: var(--lp-accent);
    margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--lp-glass-border);
    padding-bottom: 0.4rem;
  }

  .point-card p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--lp-text-dim);
  }

  /* --- Theme Section --- */
  .theme-section {
    padding: 4rem 0;
    text-align: center;
    background: rgba(216, 167, 177, 0.05);
  }

  .theme-content {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    line-height: 2;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  /* --- CTA Section --- */
  .cta-section {
    padding: 4rem 0;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .cta-card {
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    border: 1px solid var(--lp-accent);
    padding: 2rem; /* さらにスリムに */
  }

  .cta-heading {
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--lp-text);
  }

  .cta-text {
    color: var(--lp-text-dim);
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .cta-button {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    background-color: var(--lp-accent);
    color: #fff;
    text-decoration: none;
    padding: 1rem 2.5rem;
    border-radius: 2px;
    font-weight: 600;
    transition: all 0.3s ease;
  }

  .cta-button:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(216, 167, 177, 0.4);
    filter: brightness(1.05);
  }

  /* --- Footnote --- */
  .lp-footnote {
    padding: 3rem 0;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: var(--lp-text-dim);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--lp-glass-border);
  }

  /* --- Animations --- */
  @keyframes fadeInUp {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(20px);
    }
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
  }

  @keyframes fadeInDown {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(-20px);
    }
    to {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
  }

  @keyframes fadeIn {
    from {
      opacity: 0;
    }
    to {
      opacity: 1;
    }
  }

  @keyframes scrollLine {
    0% {
      transform: scaleY(0);
      transform-origin: top;
    }
    50% {
      transform: scaleY(1);
      transform-origin: top;
    }
    51% {
      transform: scaleY(1);
      transform-origin: bottom;
    }
    100% {
      transform: scaleY(0);
      transform-origin: bottom;
    }
  }

  .br-mobile {
    display: none;
  }

  /* --- Responsive --- */
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .br-mobile {
      display: inline;
    }
    .lp-container {
      margin: -2rem -1rem;
    }
    .hero-title {
      font-size: 3rem;
    }
    .hero-catch {
      font-size: 1.2rem;
    }
    .char-grid,
    .point-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
    .story-section,
    .point-section,
    .theme-section,
    .cta-section {
      padding: 5rem 0;
    }
    .story-content {
      font-size: 1rem;
    }
    .glass-card {
      padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
    }
  }
</style>
